        "text": "Page: Sangin. Sentence: It is located on in the valley of the Helmand River at 888 m altitude, 95 km to the north-east of Lashkargah.\nPage: Helmand River. Sentence: The Helmand River (also spelled \"Helmend, Helmund, Hirmand\"; Pashto/Persian: هیرمند, هلمند \"Hīrmand, Helmand \", Greek: \"Ἐτύμανδρος \" (\"Etýmandros\"), Latin: \"Erymandrus \") is the longest river in Afghanistan and the primary watershed for the endorheic Sistan Basin.",
